{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8a0c4d2e-7b3a-4f9e-9a51-1c2f3b6d4e8a",
    "name": "sendNotificationTwilio",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para el microservicio Go que envía notificaciones por WhatsApp via Twilio.\n\nEndpoints:\n- POST /notification-medication  -> notificación de medicación\n- POST /notification-approved    -> notificación de aprobación\n- POST /general-message          -> mensaje general\n\nFormato del body (JSON):\n```\n{\n  \"phone\": \"+5493804XXXXXXX\",\n  \"message_vars\": \"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"valor1\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"valor2\\\"}\"\n}\n```\n\nIMPORTANTE: `message_vars` es un STRING que contiene JSON (no un objeto). El servicio lo pasa tal cual a Twilio como ContentVariables.\n\nVariables de colección:\n- base_url : URL del servicio Go (default http://localhost:8081)\n- phone    : teléfono de prueba en formato E.164, sin el prefijo `whatsapp:` (el servicio lo agrega).\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "phone",
      "value": "+5493804230241",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Teléfono destino en formato E.164 (sin el prefijo `whatsapp:`)."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "POST /notification-medication",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"message_vars\": \"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Juan Pérez\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Ibuprofeno 600mg\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"10/06/2026\\\"}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/notification-medication",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["notification-medication"]
        },
        "description": "Envía la plantilla configurada en TWILIO_CONTENT_SID_MESSAGE.\n\nLas variables del template se pasan en `message_vars` como JSON serializado.\nLas keys (\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", ...) corresponden a los placeholders del Content Template en Twilio."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"phone\":\"+5493804230241\",\"message_vars\":\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Juan\\\"}\"}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/notification-medication"}
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Mensaje enviado correctamente\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "400 Datos inválidos",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{}"},
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/notification-medication"}
          },
          "status": "Bad Request",
          "code": 400,
          "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
          "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Datos inválidos\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "POST /notification-approved",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"message_vars\": \"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Juan Pérez\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"10/06/2026\\\"}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/notification-approved",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["notification-approved"]
        },
        "description": "Envía la plantilla configurada en TWILIO_CONTENT_SID_APPROVED (notificación de aprobación).\n\nDesde SISCON, este endpoint lo dispara `App\\Services\\TwilioSender::sendNotificationApproved()` con `[\"1\" => $nombreAfiliado, \"2\" => $fechaProceso]`."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"phone\":\"+5493804230241\",\"message_vars\":\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Juan\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"10/06/2026\\\"}\"}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/notification-approved"}
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Mensaje enviado correctamente\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "name": "500 Error de Twilio",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"phone\":\"+invalid\",\"message_vars\":\"{}\"}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/notification-approved"}
          },
          "status": "Internal Server Error",
          "code": 500,
          "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
          "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"No se pudo enviar el mensaje\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "POST /general-message",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"message_vars\": \"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Global Médica S.A.\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Su pedido fue recibido y está en proceso.\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Global Médica S.A.\\\"}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/general-message",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["general-message"]
        },
        "description": "Envía la plantilla configurada en TWILIO_CONTENT_SID_GENERAL (mensaje general).\n\nDesde SISCON, lo dispara `App\\Services\\TwilioSender::sendGeneralMessage()` con `[\"1\" => $empresa, \"2\" => $mensaje, \"3\" => $empresa]`."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"phone\":\"+5493804230241\",\"message_vars\":\"{\\\"1\\\":\\\"Global Médica\\\",\\\"2\\\":\\\"Hola\\\",\\\"3\\\":\\\"Global Médica\\\"}\"}"
            },
            "url": {"raw": "{{base_url}}/general-message"}
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}],
          "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Mensaje enviado correctamente\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Caso de error - body vacío (400)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/notification-medication",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["notification-medication"]
        },
        "description": "Body sin los campos requeridos. El servicio responde 400 con `{\"error\": \"Datos inválidos\"}`.\n\nÚtil para verificar el binding de Gin (`c.BindJSON`)."
      }
    }
  ]
}
